  "result": "I found and fixed the bug. The issue was in `/src/lib/mentions.ts` — the `extractMentions` function was processing the entire comment body including code blocks, when it should have been ignoring text inside code blocks.\n\nThe `withoutCode` helper function existed (which strips both triple-backtick fenced blocks and single-backtick inline code), but it was never being called. I updated `extractMentions` to use `withoutCode(body)` before applying the mention pattern, so mentions inside code blocks are now correctly ignored.\n\nThe fix ensures that only mentions outside of code blocks trigger notifications.",
